blueprint v1
size: 5 5 4
axes: x west->east, z north->south, y up; layer y0 = the feet level
// The draft's example exactly as written (build.out.md §3.2), kept as the
// negative fixture for the critique's finding 1: its torch is a wall torch at
// head height with no solid cell below, so it can never be placed. Counts: 71
// cobblestone + 2 entry cells = 73 placements + 1 torch.
palette:
  W: cobblestone
  T: torch
  .: air
  e: cobblestone entry
  _: keep
layer y0:
WWWWW
W...W
W...W
W...W
WWeWW
layer y1:
WWWWW
W.T.W
W...W
W...W
WWeWW
layer y2:
WWWWW
W...W
W...W
W...W
WWWWW
layer y3:
WWWWW
WWWWW
WWWWW
WWWWW
WWWWW
